<title>USA: Cellex unit gets $1.2 mln Malaysian order.</title>
<headline>Cellex unit gets $1.2 mln Malaysian order.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellex Biosciences Inc said Monday that its fermentation and stirred tank cell culture system subsidiary, LSL Biolafitte, obtained its first order in Malaysia from the University of Technology in Skudai, State of Johor.</p>
<p>The order, which was a direct result of the company's increased focus on the Far East through its distributors, has a total value of $1.2 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Cellex shares were unchanged at 1-9/16 Monday.</p>
<p>	 ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
